{"lines": [{"text": "You put a thousand dollars into savings, and your bank starts making money on it.", "start": 0.6, "end": 4.872, "spec": null, "words": [["You", 0.08, 0.148], ["put", 0.148, 0.273], ["a", 0.284, 0.341], ["thousand", 0.341, 0.92], ["dollars", 0.92, 1.25], ["into", 1.25, 1.375], ["savings", 1.375, 2.114], ["and", 2.295, 2.42], ["your", 2.432, 2.545], ["bank", 2.557, 2.898], ["starts", 2.898, 3.17], ["making", 3.17, 3.386], ["money", 3.386, 3.625], ["on", 3.625, 3.761], ["it", 3.761, 3.92]]}, {"text": "A typical savings account in the US pays only about 0.4 percent a year.", "start": 5.122, "end": 10.162, "spec": null, "words": [["A", 0.091, 0.136], ["typical", 0.148, 0.511], ["savings", 0.511, 0.898], ["account", 0.898, 1.33], ["in", 1.432, 1.511], ["the", 1.523, 1.568], ["US", 1.568, 1.977], ["pays", 1.977, 2.523], ["only", 2.659, 2.92], ["about", 2.92, 3.205], ["0.4 percent", 3.216, 4.375], ["a", 4.375, 4.386], ["year", 4.386, 4.716]]}, {"text": "On your thousand, that is roughly four dollars a year.", "start": 10.412, "end": 13.58, "spec": null, "words": [["On", 0.08, 0.159], ["your", 0.159, 0.239], ["thousand", 0.239, 0.705], ["that", 1.136, 1.239], ["is", 1.25, 1.386], ["roughly", 1.398, 1.83], ["four", 1.83, 2.125], ["dollars", 2.125, 2.432], ["a", 2.432, 2.455], ["year", 2.455, 2.83]]}, {"text": "But your money does not sit in a vault with your name on it.", "start": 13.83, "end": 16.83, "spec": null, "words": [["But", 0.102, 0.193], ["your", 0.193, 0.284], ["money", 0.284, 0.523], ["does", 0.523, 0.693], ["not", 0.693, 1.011], ["sit", 1.023, 1.432], ["in", 1.443, 1.557], ["a", 1.557, 1.591], ["vault", 1.591, 1.943], ["with", 1.955, 2.08], ["your", 2.08, 2.148], ["name", 2.148, 2.364], ["on", 2.364, 2.523], ["it", 2.523, 2.659]]}, {"text": "The bank keeps a slice ready for withdrawals and lends out much of the rest.", "start": 17.08, "end": 21.088, "spec": null, "words": [["The", 0.091, 0.17], ["bank", 0.182, 0.477], ["keeps", 0.489, 0.705], ["a", 0.705, 0.761], ["slice", 0.773, 1.205], ["ready", 1.216, 1.42], ["for", 1.432, 1.557], ["withdrawals", 1.557, 2.227], ["and", 2.409, 2.58], ["lends", 2.58, 2.795], ["out", 2.795, 2.909], ["much", 2.909, 3.114], ["of", 3.114, 3.148], ["the", 3.159, 3.216], ["rest", 3.216, 3.67]]}, {"text": "US rules have not even required banks to hold a minimum reserve since 2020.", "start": 21.338, "end": 26.666, "spec": null, "words": [["US", 0.091, 0.489], ["rules", 0.5, 0.875], ["have", 0.966, 1.148], ["not", 1.148, 1.489], ["even", 1.5, 1.75], ["required", 1.75, 2.193], ["banks", 2.193, 2.523], ["to", 2.534, 2.602], ["hold", 2.602, 2.841], ["a", 2.955, 2.977], ["minimum", 2.977, 3.455], ["reserve", 3.455, 3.966], ["since 2020", 4.125, 4.977]]}, {"text": "Someone borrows it for a new car at roughly six percent a year.", "start": 26.916, "end": 30.396, "spec": null, "words": [["Someone", 0.091, 0.352], ["borrows", 0.352, 0.739], ["it", 0.75, 0.807], ["for", 0.807, 0.932], ["a", 0.932, 0.955], ["new", 0.955, 1.205], ["car", 1.205, 1.568], ["at", 1.807, 1.966], ["roughly", 1.966, 2.261], ["six", 2.273, 2.523], ["percent", 2.523, 2.784], ["a", 2.784, 2.795], ["year", 2.807, 3.159]]}, {"text": "Someone else carries a credit card balance at around twenty percent.", "start": 30.646, "end": 34.438, "spec": null, "words": [["Someone", 0.091, 0.33], ["else", 0.33, 0.625], ["carries", 0.636, 0.966], ["a", 0.966, 1.011], ["credit", 1.023, 1.341], ["card", 1.341, 1.58], ["balance", 1.58, 2.068], ["at", 2.148, 2.284], ["around", 2.284, 2.67], ["twenty", 2.682, 2.943], ["percent", 2.943, 3.455]]}, {"text": "The gap between what you get and what borrowers pay is the bank's spread.", "start": 34.688, "end": 38.408, "spec": null, "words": [["The", 0.102, 0.148], ["gap", 0.159, 0.341], ["between", 0.352, 0.591], ["what", 0.591, 0.682], ["you", 0.682, 0.761], ["get", 0.773, 1.045], ["and", 1.182, 1.307], ["what", 1.318, 1.557], ["borrowers", 1.568, 2.045], ["pay", 2.057, 2.455], ["is", 2.602, 2.693], ["the", 2.693, 2.761], ["bank's", 2.761, 3.023], ["spread", 3.034, 3.386]]}, {"text": "On average, US banks keep roughly three cents a year for every dollar they put to work.", "start": 38.658, "end": 43.842, "spec": null, "words": [["On", 0.068, 0.182], ["average", 0.193, 0.67], ["US", 1.011, 1.386], ["banks", 1.386, 1.705], ["keep", 1.705, 1.955], ["roughly", 1.966, 2.318], ["three", 2.318, 2.693], ["cents", 2.693, 2.932], ["a", 2.943, 2.966], ["year", 2.966, 3.284], ["for", 3.284, 3.455], ["every", 3.614, 3.818], ["dollar", 3.818, 4.091], ["they", 4.102, 4.182], ["put", 4.182, 4.352], ["to", 4.364, 4.42], ["work", 4.42, 4.841]]}, {"text": "That pays for branches, staff, apps and loans that never come back, and the rest is profit.", "start": 44.092, "end": 49.612, "spec": null, "words": [["That", 0.091, 0.182], ["pays", 0.182, 0.409], ["for", 0.409, 0.534], ["branches", 0.534, 1.182], ["staff", 1.364, 1.886], ["apps", 2.273, 2.534], ["and", 2.534, 2.682], ["loans", 2.682, 3.023], ["that", 3.023, 3.136], ["never", 3.136, 3.398], ["come", 3.398, 3.58], ["back", 3.591, 3.989], ["and", 4.227, 4.284], ["the", 4.284, 4.341], ["rest", 4.341, 4.625], ["is", 4.636, 4.705], ["profit", 4.705, 5.182]]}, {"text": "And at an insured bank, your deposits are covered up to 250,000 dollars per person, per bank.", "start": 49.862, "end": 55.958, "spec": null, "words": [["And", 0.091, 0.25], ["at", 0.409, 0.511], ["an", 0.511, 0.557], ["insured", 0.557, 0.977], ["bank", 0.977, 1.352], ["your", 1.58, 1.705], ["deposits", 1.716, 2.227], ["are", 2.239, 2.33], ["covered", 2.33, 2.636], ["up", 2.648, 2.784], ["to", 2.795, 2.886], ["250,000 dollars", 2.898, 4.318], ["per", 4.318, 4.455], ["person", 4.455, 4.898], ["per", 5.261, 5.386], ["bank", 5.386, 5.75]]}, {"text": "Do you know what rate your savings account pays right now?", "start": 56.208, "end": 58.752, "spec": null, "words": [["Do", 0.091, 0.125], ["you", 0.136, 0.216], ["know", 0.216, 0.352], ["what", 0.352, 0.557], ["rate", 0.568, 0.761], ["your", 0.761, 0.886], ["savings", 0.886, 1.239], ["account", 1.25, 1.523], ["pays", 1.523, 1.727], ["right", 1.727, 1.909], ["now", 1.909, 2.205]]}], "dur": 60.55}